  "implementation": [
    "Typed target spell surcharge observes the selected definition and exact bound target subtype; pretarget completion may avoid a surcharge only if sufficient nonqualifying targets remain. Increases enter the shared wide spell total before reductions, including Harmonize.",
    "Target-color activation metadata counts distinct effective WUBRG colors through the borrowed characteristic world. The total is frozen after targets, before mana abilities and payment.",
    "Wide color-target proposals retain raw mana alternatives and use the maximum five-color reduction only as a pretarget bound. Real per-target funding and final locking recompute the exact total from the raw choice through shared power_up::reduce_wide, including taxes, X, typed reductions, source/global discounts, and target discounts. No second payment system or new public state field.",
    "ActivationLifeX adds an ordered Life clause to the existing cost transaction and uses the same resource world as source tapping, fixed life and costed mana children. The X interval checks the whole combined payment.",
    "TargetsExactlyX retains the announced u32/usize cardinality independently of TargetSpec.min u16, caps the declaration domain by distinct legal recipients, refuses early completion, and handles X0 as a nontargeted ability. Existing exact binding and resolution legality handle changed incarnations."
  ],
  "focused_cases": [
    "activation_exact_x_targets_caps_the_domain_pays_exile_and_handles_zero_and_distinctness",
    "activation_x_life_accounts_for_life_spent_by_the_required_costed_mana_child",
    "activation_x_life_declaration_and_unpaid_costs_are_owned_and_restore_without_parent",
    "activation_x_life_preserves_sorcery_tap_and_source_control_legality",
    "activation_x_life_uses_one_resource_world_and_real_tap_life_and_mana_payment",
    "target_color_and_named_tax_total_remains_locked_when_the_tax_provider_funds_itself_away",
    "target_color_choice_is_owned_indexed_private_and_restorable_after_parent_disposal",
    "target_color_discount_filters_real_targets_and_direct_activation_costs",
    "target_color_discount_uses_all_effective_colors_and_floor_zero_for_both_seats",
    "target_color_reduction_keeps_named_tax_wide_until_the_final_payable_total",
    "target_color_total_locks_before_payment_and_does_not_follow_a_new_target_incarnation",
    "target_subtype_increase_precedes_harmonize_reduction_in_proposal_and_real_payment",
    "target_subtype_surcharge_can_avoid_dragons_but_requires_extra_mana_to_choose_one",
    "target_subtype_surcharge_is_unavoidable_with_only_dragons_and_locks_before_payment"
  ],
